  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 504.07 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #13679, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 6-28-23; ss by #13807, eff 11-17-23",
